{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 116,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        224.82371520996094,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Data and studies considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.425048828125,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "This group of PICO questions was reviewed during the GDG meeting convened by WHO in June 2024,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.74658966064453,
        527.4413452148438,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "(66) using the evidence from the endTB trial  . The endTB trial was an RCT that was led by Partners In",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4066772460938,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "Health (PIH), Médecins Sans Frontières (MSF), and Interactive Research and Development (IRD); the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.2935791015625,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "aim was to improve the efficacy and safety of treatment for patients with FQ-susceptible MDR/RR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987643241882324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        154.23394775390625,
        125.01910400390625,
        168.5889434814453
      ],
      "text": "endTB trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.0478057861328,
        527.197998046875,
        190.4907989501953
      ],
      "text": "The endTB trial was a Bayesian response-adaptive randomized Phase 3, multicountry, controlled,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.24794006347656,
        527.4786987304688,
        203.69093322753906
      ],
      "text": "parallel, open-label clinical trial. Participants were randomly assigned to either the control arm, which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992947578430176,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        202.44789123535156,
        527.372802734375,
        216.89088439941406
      ],
      "text": "follows the SoC longer (18-month) regimens for MDR/RR-TB, or to one of five 39-week multidrug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        215.6479034423828,
        527.4278564453125,
        230.0908966064453
      ],
      "text": "regimens that incorporate newly approved and repurposed drugs. The duration of follow-up for all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.84791564941406,
        495.9501647949219,
        243.29090881347656
      ],
      "text": "arms ranged from a minimum of 73 weeks to a maximum of 104 weeks post-randomization.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        250.55189514160156,
        527.4443969726562,
        264.9949035644531
      ],
      "text": "The primary objective of the endTB trial was to assess whether the efficacy of each experimental",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.7518310546875,
        527.1427612304688,
        278.1948547363281
      ],
      "text": "regimen is non-inferior to that of the control. The endTB clinical trial started in 2017 and randomized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996249198913574,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.9517822265625,
        527.4376831054688,
        291.3948059082031
      ],
      "text": "and followed 754 participants over 7 years and across 12 sites in seven countries: Georgia, India,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.15179443359375,
        317.1143493652344,
        304.5948181152344
      ],
      "text": "Kazakhstan, Lesotho, Pakistan, Peru and South Africa.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.8558349609375,
        527.4081420898438,
        326.2988586425781
      ],
      "text": "Eligible participants were aged at least 15 years and had pulmonary TB suspected or confirmed to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.0558166503906,
        527.1848754882812,
        339.49884033203125
      ],
      "text": "be resistant to rifampicin and susceptible to FQ. Participants living with HIV (regardless of CD4 count),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988143920898438,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.25579833984375,
        527.2509765625,
        352.6988220214844
      ],
      "text": "diabetes (regardless of A1c), substance use disorders and various degrees of TB disease severity were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987692832946777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.455810546875,
        527.1641235351562,
        365.8988342285156
      ],
      "text": "enrolled in the trial. All study arms were similar in size (ranging from 107 to 122) with 699 participants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989595413208008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        364.6557922363281,
        384.7269592285156,
        379.09881591796875
      ],
      "text": "in the modified intention-to-treat (mITT) population for the analysis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.3597106933594,
        527.3959350585938,
        400.802734375
      ],
      "text": "All five experimental regimens were of 9 months (i.e. 39 weeks) duration. Three of these regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.5596923828125,
        527.4366455078125,
        414.0027160644531
      ],
      "text": "included bedaquiline for the whole duration of the regimen (400 mg once daily for the first 2 weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.75970458984375,
        527.3514404296875,
        427.2027282714844
      ],
      "text": "of treatment, followed by 200 mg 3 times per week), a quinolone (either moxifloxacin or levofloxacin),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987242698669434,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.959716796875,
        527.2619018554688,
        440.4027404785156
      ],
      "text": "linezolid, pyrazinamide, and either delamanid (100 mg BID) or clofazimine or no fifth drug. The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.1596984863281,
        527.5783081054688,
        453.60272216796875
      ],
      "text": "remaining two regimens were without bedaquiline but included delamanid, a quinolone (moxifloxacin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978428840637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        452.3597106933594,
        524.6029663085938,
        466.802734375
      ],
      "text": "or levofloxacin), clofazimine and pyrazinamide, with or without linezolid as a fifth medicine (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.44970703125,
        527.4325561523438,
        480.0027160644531
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.4 ). All patients who received linezolid started at 600 mg daily but were later randomized",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.75970458984375,
        524.4424438476562,
        493.2027282714844
      ],
      "text": "to a reduced dose (300 mg daily or 600 mg 3 times a week) at 16 weeks or earlier in case of dose-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.959716796875,
        143.17567443847656,
        506.4027404785156
      ],
      "text": "limiting toxicity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.8702392578125,
        244.98609924316406,
        540.6982421875
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.4. endTB trial regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
